sts: Tragic first loves in Ananke System, followed by three new romances if you make it to Thallo System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional storytelling, rich character dynamics, and the freedom to choose love… or drift away</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jupiter's Orbit is a choice-driven romantasy visual novel/dating sim.</i></p>",
